name: Acknowledged study and context drafts survive idle exit and explicit restart recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | context-prepared
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Common policy context
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | imported
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | baseline-inspected
keys: b n C-u
type: Baseline policy
keys: Home Right
require-live-snap: 25 Study choices saved locally | name-checkpointed
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | first-restart
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 RECOVER STUDY DRAFT | name-recovery
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 NAME CONTEXT CASE | name-stayed
expect: Baseline policy
keys: Delete
require-live-snap: 20 Bseline | cursor-proof
keys: C-End C-u
type: Baseline policy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | baseline-named
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | leaving-cases
keys: Escape
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 RECOVER STUDY DRAFT | back-keeps-cases
expect: Baseline policy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | recovered-unprepared-cases
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | candidate-base
keys: e
require-live-snap: 20 EDIT CONTEXT COPY | copy-editor
keys: Enter C-u
paste-file: @ART/candidate-context.txt
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Draft saved locally | copy-checkpointed
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT SUMMARY | hidden-copy
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | hidden-copy-restart
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 RECOVER STUDY DRAFT | both-drafts-recovery
resize: 160x48
live-snap: study-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: study-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: study-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: study-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: study-40x12
ask: Are acknowledged study choices recoverable after idle exit, with clear selection controls and no automatic jobs or spending?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study-restored
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | copy-base-restored
keys: e
require-live-snap: 25 RECOVER CONTEXT DRAFT | copy-recovery
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ↑↓ Enter edit | copy-fields-restored
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owner context for harmless | copy-restored
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW CONTEXT CHANGES | copy-review
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Edited copy saved | copy-saved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owner context for harmless | candidate-inspected
keys: + n C-u
type: Owner context
keys: Enter Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | two-case-study
expect: 2 contexts · 6 fixed jobs
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | review
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | cases
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Matrix draft ready | saved-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does Stay return to the exact editor and cursor, while explicit copy saving and draft preparation make the two named cases recoverable without approving work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 planned | unapproved-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ┌ CONTEXT CASES | recovered-cases
expect: Baseline policy
expect: Owner context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does no-color restart retain the saved baseline, candidate and exact contexts with no queue, allowance approval, scanner work or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
